Capital damages=
	if then else(Act Capital Damages=0,0,if then else(Act Capital Damages=1,Pessimistic capital damage function
,if then else(Act Capital Damages=2, Optimistic capital damage function, Capital Extreme Event Shock
	)))*Capital impacts reduction due to adaptation
	~	Dmnl
	~		|

Capital ER= INTEG (
	Inv ER-Depreciation ER,
		Initial Capital ER)
	~	Euro
	~		|

Capital Extreme Event Shock=
	min(1,if then else(Mean temperature increase >3 :AND: Mean temperature increase < 3.2
,
	                     Capital Extreme Events, 0))
	~	Dmnl
	~	This extreme climate shock appears when Temperature Increase reaches 3ºC, \
		reflecting the idea of dramatic and abrupt changes when temperature \
		increases are beyond 2.5ºC, according to Dangerous Climate Change \
		literature.
	|

